  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CSSF Technical Support for the Expansion and Improvement of the Jordanian National Aid Fund&apos;s Cash Assistance Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this programme is to extend the support of NAF&apos;s expansion during phase 2 through 2019-2020 to increase the number of beneficiaries by an additional 30,000 to add up to a total of 55,000 in 2020.  By 2021, the Government of Jordan will be able to expand provision of the National Aid Fund to an additional 85,000 vulnerable households to help mitigate the impact of economic reforms on the most vulnerable Jordanians.</narrative>
  </description>
